<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">This
Report on Form 6-K of SMX (Security Matters) Public Limited Company (the &#8220;Company&#8221;) attaches as Exhibit 99.1 the audited
consolidated financial statements and related notes of the Company as and for fiscal year ended December 31, 2024 included in the Company&#8217;s
Form 20-F, as amended, filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on May 14, 2025, to reflect the subsequent 4.1:1 reverse stock
split, which went effective on June 16, 2025.</span></p>

